    <updated>2026-09-15T03:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <id>https://quill-lang.example/blog/quill-6.4-released/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Quill 6.4 is now available. Highlights include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Faster builds&lt;/strong&gt;, with the new &lt;code class=&quot;language-plaintext highlighter-rouge&quot;&gt;--incremental&lt;/code&gt; mode on by default.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearer errors&lt;/strong&gt; for mismatched brackets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Try it today by following the instructions on the &lt;a href=&quot;/install/&quot;&gt;Install Quill&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
